  "title": "AGPC 0.2.0-15 \u2014 fix uChat CX-Mesh configuration access",
  "notes": "Updates uchat to 3.2.0-3 and uchatd to 0.4.0-2. Fixes the daemon permission failure reading protected CX-Mesh configuration during installation and setup. Preserves owner permissions, service identity, configuration and Inbox data. Agent Sphere 0.2.0-15 and Agent Apps 0.2.0-4 make the normal installer upgrade both chat packages on existing hosts. Other component pins are unchanged. Signed APT activation and remote runtime readiness are separate from this immutable bundle.",
